  "evidence": "TEXT_E: Get Brexit done (leave customs union/single market; UK–EU FTA in 2020), 50,000 more nurses and 50 million more GP appointments, 20,000 more police and tougher sentencing, an Australian-style points-based immigration system to reduce overall numbers, no rises in income tax/VAT/NI rates, £100bn infrastructure and at least a million homes. TEXT_D: Stop Brexit (revoke Article 50 or a People’s Vote), 1p on Income Tax for NHS and social care, Net Zero by 2045 with 80% renewables by 2030, proportional representation and constitutional reform, liberal migration reforms (ending hostile environment, detention limits, right to work), legal regulated cannabis.",
